// Title: HackTool - PurpleSharp Execution
// ID: ff23ffbc-3378-435e-992f-0624dcf93ab4
// Status: test
// Level: critical
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-06-18
// Tags: attack.t1587, attack.resource-development
// Description: Detects the execution of the PurpleSharp adversary simulation tool
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_xyz123456.exe*" or process.command_line like "*_PurpleSharp*")) or ((process.executable like "*_\\purplesharp*") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "PurpleSharp.exe")))
